\section{Usage}{


The most important functions of the package are \code{\link[=zanicc]{zanicc()}} for carrying out Bayesian
inference in several (non)parametric count compositional models and
\code{\link[=inverse_posterior_zanimlnbart]{inverse_posterior_zanimlnbart()}} for performing pollen-based palaeoclimate
reconstruction under a modular framework build on the ZANIM-LN-BART model.
}

